Thu Oct 29 14:46:02 UTC 2026 - Andrea Manzini <andrea.manzini@suse.com>

- Initial package, version 1.3.2
  * Build on x86_64, aarch64 and ppc64le only: Dolt does not build
    on 32-bit and the other architectures are untested
  * Build against the system sqlite (libsqlite3 tag) instead of
    the copy bundled in go-sqlite3
  * %check is a smoke test: upstream's suite is large and some
    of its tests assume the opt-out metrics default
  * Add 0001-make-usage-metrics-opt-in.patch: do not send
    anonymous usage metrics unless the user runs "bd metrics on"

